-- Plain-language promises. Every line here is something the product actually does; staff can edit, and a lawyer should review before launch.
INSERT INTO pages(slug, title, body, needs_legal_review) VALUES
 ('our-guarantee', 'Our shopping promises', E'## What we promise\n- **Pay what you saw.** The price at checkout is the price you pay, plus any delivery fee and GST shown before you pay. Prices are checked again at the moment you pay.\n- **Never charged for a swap.** If a store replaces an item, it is at no extra charge, and you choose in advance per item whether to be asked, get the closest match, or be refunded.\n- **Missing, wrong or damaged?** Report it from your order within 48 hours of delivery. When a report is confirmed, we refund the affected items.\n- **Your tip goes to your driver.** 100% of it. If your delivery does not happen, it is refunded.\n- **Honest reviews.** Ratings come only from people who received the order. A rating is shown only after at least three reviews, so one opinion cannot mislead.\n- **No fake urgency.** We do not use countdown timers or pretend stock levels to rush you.\n- **We do not sell your personal information.** Marketing email is sent only if you said yes, and every email has a one-click unsubscribe.\n\n## What stores control\nEach store sets its own prices, stock and opening hours. Delivery times are estimates, not guarantees.\n\n## Need help?\nVisit the help centre or open the order and choose Report a problem.', true)
ON CONFLICT (slug) DO NOTHING;
